---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="SMS Opt-In | The One Group" description="Opt in to receive text messages from The One Group. Manage your preferences, opt out anytime, and review our SMS program terms.">

  <section class="pt-32 pb-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-display font-bold mb-4">SMS Opt-In</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-8">The One Group's text message program — including our Family Assistant service.</p>

      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold mb-4">Opt In to Receive Text Messages</h2>
        <p class="mb-4">By providing your mobile number and opting in below, you <strong>agree to receive text messages from The One Group</strong> related to the service you requested. This may include calendar reminders, task notifications, and assistant replies.</p>

        <form class="space-y-4" onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); document.getElementById('optin-success').classList.remove('hidden');">
          <div>
            <label for="phone" class="block text-sm font-medium mb-1">Mobile Number</label>
            <input type="tel" id="phone" name="phone" placeholder="(555) 555-5555" class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-900" required />
          </div>
          <label class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm">
            <input type="checkbox" required class="mt-1" />
            <span>I agree to receive text messages from The One Group at the number provided. I understand that <strong>message and data rates may apply</strong>, message frequency varies, and I can opt out at any time by replying <strong>STOP</strong>. I consent to receive SMS as described in our <a href="/terms/" class="underline">Terms</a> and <a href="/privacy/" class="underline">Privacy Policy</a>.</span>
          </label>
          <button type="submit" class="w-full px-6 py-3 rounded-lg bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-semibold">Opt In</button>
        </form>

        <div id="optin-success" class="hidden mt-4 p-4 rounded-lg bg-green-50 dark:bg-green-900/20 text-green-800 dark:text-green-300 text-sm">
          ✅ You're opted in! You can also opt in anytime by texting <strong>START</strong>, <strong>YES</strong>, or <strong>UNSTOP</strong> to our number.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="prose prose-gray dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
        <h2>How to Opt In</h2>
        <p>You can opt in to receive text messages from The One Group in two ways:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Via this page:</strong> Enter your mobile number above and check the consent box.</li>
          <li><strong>Via text:</strong> Text <strong>START</strong>, <strong>YES</strong>, or <strong>UNSTOP</strong> to our number to opt in.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Message Frequency</h2>
        <p>Message frequency varies. You will only receive messages you request or that are necessary to provide the service you signed up for. We do not send promotional or marketing texts unless you have separately opted in to marketing.</p>

        <h2>Opt Out Anytime</h2>
        <p>You can opt out of text messages at any time by replying <strong>STOP</strong> to any message you receive. You'll receive a confirmation that you've been unsubscribed. You may also contact us to opt out.</p>

        <h2>Help &amp; Support</h2>
        <p>Reply <strong>HELP</strong> to any message for help, or contact us at <a href="mailto:akennedy@theonegroup.info">akennedy@theonegroup.info</a> or (502) 403-7201.</p>

        <h2>Message &amp; Data Rates</h2>
        <p><strong>Message and data rates may apply.</strong> Check with your mobile carrier for details. Carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages.</p>

        <h2>Your Privacy</h2>
        <p>We do not sell, rent, or share your mobile number with third parties for their own marketing purposes. See our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> for full details.</p>

        <h2>Terms</h2>
        <p>By opting in, you agree to our <a href="/terms/">Terms of Service</a>, including the SMS program terms.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
